      "text": "<math><mn>40 m/s</mn></math> <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi></mrow><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math>",
